flowchart TB
    accTitle: Proposed comparison data and trusted policy remain separate
    accDescr: A pull request's proposed head supplies comparison data. The privileged applying route takes instructions and referenced templates only from an immutable trusted base, a deliberately pinned revision, or built-in policy. Proposed policy has no route into privileged instruction execution.

    trusted("Trusted base, pinned revision, or built-in policy")
    proposed("Proposed pull request head")
    proposedPolicy("Proposed policy and templates"):::bad
    blocked("Rejected as privileged instructions"):::bad
    analyze("Analyze proposed changes with trusted policy"):::focus
    apply("Apply declared effects under host authority"):::ok

    trusted ~~~ proposed
    proposed ~~~ proposedPolicy
    proposedPolicy ~~~ blocked
    blocked ~~~ analyze

    trusted -->|"trusted policy and referenced templates"| analyze
    proposed -->|"comparison data only"| analyze
    proposed -->|"may contain"| proposedPolicy
    proposedPolicy -->|"not an instruction source"| blocked
    analyze -->|"desired effects bound to source identity"| apply
